Subject: [PATCH] rustic: vanilla options on the settings shell

options_shell: vanilla's Options and its pages (Music & Sounds, Controls with
Mouse Settings, Chat, Accessibility with Font, Skin Customization, Online) as the
pages of one settings_shell screen, each row the vanilla option itself, for an
executable that turns it on (install(on, language)); it may leave the Language page
out and name the settings screens' mark (set_brand). Off by default: nothing
changes. Rustic ADR 0014, U18.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
